{"4959580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ouroboros", "steam_appid": 4959580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BODY IS YOUR DECK. BITE IT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/5578529bd64b40e43a95d9feb3bedfdb.poster.avif?t=1787935923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/5578529bd64b40e43a95d9feb3bedfdb.webm?t=1787935923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/5578529bd64b40e43a95d9feb3bedfdb.mp4?t=1787935923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of food you eat becomes a working part of your body. A Fang Turret shoots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Venom Gland trails poison. A Blast Sac smoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you deliberately steer your head into your own body, that part <strong>detonates</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That is the whole game.</strong> Growing makes you stronger and harder to steer. Biting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >makes you weaker and gets you out of trouble. Every second you are deciding which of</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >those you need more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/f14cea082b522a996a00a4dcecc1aab6.poster.avif?t=1787935923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/f14cea082b522a996a00a4dcecc1aab6.webm?t=1787935923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/f14cea082b522a996a00a4dcecc1aab6.mp4?t=1787935923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LENGTH IS THE PROBLEM AND THE SOLUTION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fourteen body parts</strong>, each with a passive that runs constantly and a detonate that fires once. Stack Storm Batteries next to turrets. Put an Echo Scale between two bombs. Find out what a Glut Sac does to its neighbours.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your body is a wall </strong>— to your enemies, and to you. Coil around a boss to pen it in</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  and you have penned yourself in too. Chewing back out costs you time you may not have.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two ways to detonate.</strong> Bite a part you choose, where you choose, and stand still</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  for it. Or drop your tail as a live charge, walk away, and set it off when something</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  is standing on it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIFTEEN WAVES, THREE BOSSES, ONE RUN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run is about fifteen minutes. Death ends it. There is no mid-run save.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five enemy types that each break a different habit. Spitters punish turtling. Tanks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  chew through your body — the only thing in the game that can.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shepherd</strong> kites and summons. <strong>The Collector</strong> ignores you and eats your food</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  to heal. <strong>The World Serpent</strong> is a rival snake with its own body, its own tail, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  the habit of biting it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, draft one of three new parts — and choose where on your body it goes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then do it forever. Endless mode keeps generating waves past the fifteenth, with the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bosses coming back around and the pressure compounding until something kills you. Your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deepest runs are kept.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BODY IS YOUR DECK. BITE IT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/5578529bd64b40e43a95d9feb3bedfdb.poster.avif?t=1787935923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/5578529bd64b40e43a95d9feb3bedfdb.webm?t=1787935923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/5578529bd64b40e43a95d9feb3bedfdb.mp4?t=1787935923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of food you eat becomes a working part of your body. A Fang Turret shoots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Venom Gland trails poison. A Blast Sac smoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you deliberately steer your head into your own body, that part <strong>detonates</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That is the whole game.</strong> Growing makes you stronger and harder to steer. Biting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >makes you weaker and gets you out of trouble. Every second you are deciding which of</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >those you need more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/f14cea082b522a996a00a4dcecc1aab6.poster.avif?t=1787935923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/f14cea082b522a996a00a4dcecc1aab6.webm?t=1787935923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/extras/f14cea082b522a996a00a4dcecc1aab6.mp4?t=1787935923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LENGTH IS THE PROBLEM AND THE SOLUTION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fourteen body parts</strong>, each with a passive that runs constantly and a detonate that fires once. Stack Storm Batteries next to turrets. Put an Echo Scale between two bombs. Find out what a Glut Sac does to its neighbours.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your body is a wall </strong>— to your enemies, and to you. Coil around a boss to pen it in</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  and you have penned yourself in too. Chewing back out costs you time you may not have.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two ways to detonate.</strong> Bite a part you choose, where you choose, and stand still</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  for it. Or drop your tail as a live charge, walk away, and set it off when something</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  is standing on it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIFTEEN WAVES, THREE BOSSES, ONE RUN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run is about fifteen minutes. Death ends it. There is no mid-run save.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five enemy types that each break a different habit. Spitters punish turtling. Tanks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  chew through your body — the only thing in the game that can.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shepherd</strong> kites and summons. <strong>The Collector</strong> ignores you and eats your food</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  to heal. <strong>The World Serpent</strong> is a rival snake with its own body, its own tail, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  the habit of biting it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, draft one of three new parts — and choose where on your body it goes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then do it forever. Endless mode keeps generating waves past the fifteenth, with the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bosses coming back around and the pressure compounding until something kills you. Your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deepest runs are kept.</p>", "short_description": "Snake, but every scrap of food becomes a working body part. Bite your own body and that part detonates. Turrets, venom, blast sacs — your length is your loadout, your ammunition, and the thing in your way. Fifteen waves. Three bosses.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/1bb852299dc9ec8f8cdbf5b88057ea07686bc8be/header.jpg?t=1787935923", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/adc1efac69dd343cd0392bef33300defc05379dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787935923", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959580/adc1efac69dd343cd0392bef33300defc05379dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787935923", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 capable, integrated is fine<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u